Saved to `ADR-001-notification-architecture.md`. The ADR argues for Redis Streams on the basis of:

- **Time to value**: 2-week constraint rules out Kafka — no team experience means a Kafka cluster takes 2+ weeks to reach production-readiness; Redis Streams POC fits in days.
- **Operational fit**: Team already runs Redis, no new infrastructure, existing monitoring/backup runbooks apply.
